include ../accordion/_accordion
// FAQ
section#faq.section.section-lg.bg-primary-light
	.container
		.row: .col
			h2 Frequently asked questions
			p.lead Here are some of the frequently asked questions submitted by our first-time and regular clients.
		.row
			.col: #accordion1.accordion.accordion-flush
				+accordion-item({
					parentId: 'accordion1',
					title: 'How long will it take to fix my phone?',
				})
					p Turnaround time is 2-7 days after receiving the phone depending on job and availability of parts. Most jobs are completed within 2-3 days. This does depend on the fault, make of phone, and parts required.

				+accordion-item({
					parentId: 'accordion1',
					title: 'Why do the charges differ?',
				})
					p Each repair is priced on time taken, type of damage, and any parts needed. Until we assess the damage, we can not know the true cost of repair. A deposit will be taken before we assess the damage.

				+accordion-item({
					parentId: 'accordion1',
					title: 'Do I need an appointment?',
				})
					p We offer a drop-in service -- no appointments are necessary as we offer a drop-in service on a first come, first served basis. Please bring your phone in at your convenience. If you choose to book online, you can receive a $10 saving, but this does not guarantee you an appointment at this time-- we will advise you on the wait time when you arrive.

				+accordion-item({
					parentId: 'accordion1',
					title: 'What happens if you can’t fix my device?',
					show: true
				})
					p If we can't fix your device we will get in touch with you to discuss your options. We can either offer you a replacement device for a cost, or we can return the device to you and refund your service charge.
